// KSI social-service codes to ICF mappings, codes W-XAA
// Several sources map to the same target; each mapping is its own assertion.
context {
 collection "ksi-icf" version="2026.1"
 source system="KSI" release="2026"
 target system="ICF"
}
defaults {
 mappings {
 preference "primary"
 assessment-method "source-default-granularity"
 }
}
assessment "WA-WZ.omop" source="WA-WZ" outcome=no_match target-system="OMOP_EXT"
mapping "WXA.1" source="WXA" target="d5705" relationship=related_to {
 confidence 2 scheme="vocabmod-se-confidence-unassessable@1"
 comment "en" """
 Source WXA = the KSI domain code for mental-health-focused activities (a
 health-domain framing). Target ICF d5705 (Looking after one's
 mental health) is the canonical ICF self-care concept for mental health. The KSI source is a
 health-domain framing of the same area that d5705 represents as a self-care activity (different
 axis: domain-of-focus vs self-care-activity), so related rather than exact_match or broader per
 the about/concept-axis-mismatch pattern established for sibling KSI domain parents (VEC/VED in
 proposal-0007, VEE in proposal-0008); weak. d5705 verified present in
 source/function/ICF/concepts.tdl.
 """ suspect=quoted-text
}
mapping "WXA.AM.ZZ.1" source="WXA.AM.ZZ" target="d5705" relationship=related_to {
 confidence 2 scheme="vocabmod-se-confidence-unassessable@1"
 comment "en" """
 Source WXA.AM.ZZ = observation activity regarding mental health.
 Target ICF d5705 (Looking after one's mental health), the
 canonical mental-health self-care concept. Source is an observation ABOUT the mental-health
 domain, not a case of it; related, weak per the about/observation pattern. d5705 verified in ICF
 mirror.
 """ suspect=quoted-text
}
mapping "WXA.AS.ZZ.1" source="WXA.AS.ZZ" target="d5705" relationship=related_to {
 confidence 2 scheme="vocabmod-se-confidence-unassessable@1"
 comment "en" """
 Source WXA.AS.ZZ = investigative/assessment conversation
 regarding mental health. Target ICF d5705 (Looking after one's
 mental health). Source is an assessment activity ABOUT the mental-health domain; related, weak.
 d5705 verified in ICF mirror.
 """ suspect=quoted-text
}
mapping "WXA.AT.ZZ.1" source="WXA.AT.ZZ" target="d5705" relationship=related_to {
 confidence 2 scheme="vocabmod-se-confidence-unassessable@1"
 comment "en" """
 Source WXA.AT.ZZ = gathering
 information from a professional about mental health. Target ICF d5705 (Looking after one's mental health). Source is an information-gathering activity ABOUT
