mapping "WXB.1" source="WXB" target="d5702" relationship=related_to effect=omitted quality=60 {
 confidence 2 scheme="vocabmod-se-confidence-unassessable@1"
 comment "en" """
 Source WXB = the KSI domain code for physical-health-focused activities (a
 health-domain framing). ICF has no dedicated 'physical health' self-care child; the closest
 standard concept is d5702 (Maintaining one's own health), the
 general health-maintenance self-care concept. The KSI source is a physical-health-domain framing
 of the area d5702 represents as a self-care activity (different axis: domain-of-focus vs
 self-care-activity), so related rather than exact_match or broader per the
 about/concept-axis-mismatch pattern established for sibling KSI domain parents; weak. d5702
 verified present in source/function/ICF/concepts.tdl.
 """ suspect=quoted-text
}
