mapping "WZZ.1" source="WZZ" target="d5709" relationship=related_to {
 confidence 2 scheme="vocabmod-se-confidence-unassessable@1"
 comment "en" """
 Source WZZ = the KSI domain code for activities with an unspecified
 focus area (a residual/unspecified-focus framing). Target ICF d5709 (Looking after one's own health, unspecified) is the ICF unspecified-level
 self-care concept — the closest standard concept thematically (both are 'unspecified'
 health/wellbeing activity). The KSI source is an unspecified-social-service-activity framing
 (axis: social-service activity focus) vs d5709's unspecified-self-care framing (axis: personal
 self-care), so related rather than exact_match (different granularity axis despite shared
 'unspecified' qualifier); weak per the concept-axis-mismatch pattern. d5709 verified present in
 source/function/ICF/concepts.tdl.
 """ suspect=quoted-text
}
