mapping "WZZ.PN.ZZ.1" source="WZZ.PN.ZZ" target="d5709" relationship=related_to {
 confidence 2 scheme="vocabmod-se-confidence-unassessable@1"
 comment "en" """
 Source WZZ.PN.ZZ = a Swedish social-service
 ACTIVITY of giving advice or information with unspecified focus (WZZ = unspecified-focus
 qualifier, KSI source confirmed in source/social/KSI/concepts.tdl). Target ICF d5709 (Looking after one's own health, unspecified). The source is an
 advisory/informational intervention ABOUT an unspecified health/life-management domain (not the
 self-care act itself), so a related link per the family-history/about pattern (weak). The
 unspecified-focus qualifier prevents asserting a more specific ICF domain; d5709 is the
 canonical unspecified-health-management concept. d5709 verified present in
 source/function/ICF/concepts.tdl. Consistent with WZZ.* unspecified-focus convention in
 proposal-0010.
 """ suspect=quoted-text
}
mapping "WZZ.PU.ZZ.1" source="WZZ.PU.ZZ" target="d350" relationship=related_to {
 confidence 2 scheme="vocabmod-se-confidence-unassessable@1"
 comment "en" """
 Source WZZ.PU.ZZ = supporting conversation with
 unspecified focus (samtal = conversation/dialogue). Target ICF d350
 (Conversation), the canonical ICF communication concept for conversation. The source is a
 conversational intervention ABOUT an unspecified domain (not the conversation act the client
 performs themselves), so related, weak per the about/counseling pattern. d350 verified present
 in source/function/ICF/concepts.tdl. Differentiated from PN/WZZ support codes because PU is
 explicitly a samtal (conversation) act, mapping to the conversation domain rather than the
 unspecified-health-management concept.
 """ suspect=quoted-text
}
